# DA audit → OWNER review (automatic)

When completing any **DA–DE READ-ONLY audit** (full audit or regression audit):

1. **Always** run the matching post-audit OWNER review hook via `scripts/lib/audit-post-run.js` (or the orchestrator that calls it).
2. **Always** commit and push together with the audit report:
   - `reports/da-*-owner-review-*.md`
   - `reports/da-*-owner-decisions*.md`
   - `reports/da-*-owner-accepted*.md`
   - `reports/da-*-owner-review-GITHUB.md` (clickable GitHub links)
3. **Never** wait for the user to ask for OWNER review / accepted files — this is part of the standard audit deliverable.
4. Use `--skip-owner-review` only when Luna batches are not yet ready and a second pass is planned.

Module keys: `verbs-full`, `verbs-regression`, `verbs-final-post-repair`, `sentences-full`, `c1c2-full`, `b1-full`, `b2-full`, `b1-final-regression`.

See also: `owner-readiness-gate-universal.mdc` — do not claim OWNER ready without `audit-post-run` + coverage 100% + verify PASS.
